er</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>Mean educational level (years)</bold></td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">8</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">7</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>Proxy respondents (%)</bold></td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">14</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">17</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap><table-wrap id="t2-mjm12_1p70" position="float"><label>Table 2.</label><caption><p>Odds ratio (OR)<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn1-mjm12_1p70">*</xref> and 95% confidence interval (CI) for prostate cancer associated with ever exposure to selected chemicals during farming</p></caption><table frame="box" rules="all"><thead><tr><th align="left" content-type="background-color:#A8A8A8" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>Exposure</bold></th><th align="center" content-type="background-color:#A8A8A8" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>N<sub>ca</sub></bold></th><th align="center" content-type="background-color:#A8A8A8" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>OR</bold></th><th align="center" content-type="background-color:#A8A8A8" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>95%CI</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>Pesticides</bold></td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">25</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.4</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.7&#x02013;2.7</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>Arsenic compounds</bold></td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">15</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.4</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.6&#x02013;3.0</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>Acetic acid</bold></td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">12</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.5</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.7&#x02013;3.4</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>Gasoline engine emissions</bold></td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.3</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.4&#x02013;4.5</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>Diesel engine emissions</bold></td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5.7</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.2&#x02013;26.5</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>Polycyclic aromatic hydrocarbons from petroleum</bold></td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">6</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.4</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.3&#x02013;5.8</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>Lubricating oils and greases</bold></td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">9</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.5</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.6&#x02013;4.0</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>Alkanes with &#x02265;18 carbons</bold></td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">9</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.8</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.7&#x02013;5.0</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>Solvents</bold></td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">7</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.8</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.6&#x02013;5.6</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan=